{% extends 'SDG-Microsite/base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy | FEU Institute of Technology{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    {# Hero Section #}
    <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0">
            <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: url('{{ asset('images/library.jpg') }}'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-feu-green-900/80"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center">
                <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white font-bebas tracking-wide mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-feu-green-50 font-medium font-work max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    How we collect, use, and protect your data at FEU Institute of Technology.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {# Content Section #}
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl p-8 md:p-16 border border-gray-100">
                
                <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 font-work leading-relaxed space-y-20">
                    
                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p class="italic bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-feu-green-700">Disclaimer: This privacy notice only covers the official website of FEU Institute of Technology at <a href="https://www.feutech.edu.ph" class="text-feu-green-700 font-bold hover:underline">www.feutech.edu.ph</a>. Other FEU Institute of Technology sites related to student and alumni services may be governed by separate policies.</p>
                            <p>
                                This is the official website of the FEU Institute of Technology. We have developed this Privacy Policy to notify you about our privacy practices. We value your rights to privacy and ensure that any personal information collected on or through this site will be treated in accordance with Republic Act No. 10173, or the Data Privacy Act of 2012, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100">

                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">2. Information Gathering and Usage</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p>As part of our security protocol using a firewall, this site automatically records technical information about your visit. This may be used for general purposes such as:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
                                <li>Page interaction information and response times</li>
                                <li>Pages viewed and searched for</li>
                                <li>Time zone settings and IP address</li>
                                <li>Browser type and version</li>
                                <li>Date and time of visit and connection</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                This site makes use of <strong>cookies</strong> which are small amounts of data stored on your device memory. Cookies are required to use our services and to record current session information.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100">

                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">3. Storage and Retention</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p>
                                All information collected is stored using our third-party service providers and hosting partners to provide the necessary hardware, software, networking, storage, and related technology required to run FEU Institute of Technology. This information can only be accessed by authorized personnel and agents and is retained until its declared purpose has been achieved.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100">

                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">4. Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p>The information collected is not shared with or sold to other organizations for commercial purposes except under special circumstances, such as when you permit us, to investigate illegal activities, or when required by law (e.g., subpoenas).</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100">

                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">5. Security</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p>
                                We adopt technical and organizational measures to prevent the alteration, loss, unauthorized processing, or access of personal data. However, we cannot guarantee absolute security over the Internet. We ask that you remain responsible in sharing confidential information such as passwords and emails.
                            </p>
                            <div class="bg-feu-green-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-feu-green-100">
                                <p class="font-bold text-feu-green-900 mb-4 text-xl font-bebas tracking-widest uppercase">Report Vulnerabilities:</p>
                                <p>Please report any vulnerabilities to our Data Privacy Office at <a href="mailto:dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph" class="text-feu-green-700 font-bold hover:underline">dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph</a>.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100">

                    <section class="pt-4">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-feu-green-900 font-bebas tracking-wide mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">6. Your Rights</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 px-2">
                            <p>As a data subject, you are granted rights under the Data Privacy Act of 2012, including:</p>
                            <ul class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-6 font-medium">
                                <li>The right to be informed about collection and processing.</li>
                                <li>The right to demand access to your information.</li>
                                <li>The right to object to processing based on consent or legitimate interest.</li>
                                <li>The right to suspend, withdraw, or order the blocking/destruction of data.</li>
                                <li>The right to claim compensation for damages.</li>
                                <li>The right to file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission.</li>
                                <li>The right to data portability.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-12 text-center">
                        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xl mb-4 font-bebas tracking-wide uppercase">Contact the Data Protection Officer</p>
                        <p class="text-sm">
                            FEU Institute of Technology<br>
                            P. Paredes Street, Sampaloc, Manila<br>
                            +632 8281 8888<br>
                            Email: <a href="mailto:dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph" class="text-feu-green-700 font-bold hover:underline">dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph</a>
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    {# DPO Footer Image #}
                    <div class="mt-16 flex justify-center border-t border-gray-100 pt-12">
                        <img src="{{ asset('images/DPO_Footer.png') }}" alt="Data Privacy Office" class="h-40 object-contain transition-all duration-500">
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}
